# BADA 3 transactional direct vertical-state gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada3-envelope-vertical-direct
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3 DIRECT VERTICAL STATE GATE ===
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST INFO Runtime model bounds decide every result and generated evidence is ignored.
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.50>DT 0.05
00:00:00.60>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00
00:00:01.00>CRE B3VR,A320,41.30,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.10>CRE B3VE,A320,41.32,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS B3VR KINEMATIC
00:00:01.30>DYNAMICS B3VE KINEMATIC
00:00:01.40>VS B3VR 500
00:00:01.50>VS B3VE 500
00:00:02.00>ENVELOPECHECKS B3VR CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:02.10>ENVELOPECHECKS B3VE CUSTOM ROC_MAX
00:00:02.20>ENVELOPE B3VR REPORT
00:00:02.30>ENVELOPE B3VE ENFORCE
00:00:02.40>RECORDRESEARCH INTERVAL 0.1
00:00:03.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-envelope-vertical-direct.csv
00:00:03.10>ECHO TEST ACTION Applying the same excessive direct climb rate to REPORT and ENFORCE.
00:00:04.00>MOVE B3VR,41.50,2.50,FL200,90,250,10000
00:00:04.20>MOVE B3VE,41.52,2.50,FL200,90,250,10000
00:00:05.10>PERFSTATUS B3VR
00:00:05.20>PERFSTATUS B3VE
00:00:06.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:06.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_bada3_vertical.py with --direct.
00:00:07.00>HOLD
